SUMMARY:W5D5 — Easy Bike + Strength B
DESCRIPTION:Easy Bike 45–50 min\n• RPE 2/10\n• 不追功率\n• 5×20 sec 高踏频 @ 100–110 rpm\n• 每次之间 2 min easy\n\nStrength B 25–30 min\n1. Single-leg RDL — 2×6/侧\n2. Step-up — 2×8/侧\n3. Soleus calf raise — 3×10\n4. Hamstring curl — 2×8\n5. Side plank — 2组\n\n目标：增加第三次骑行频率，不制造额外疲劳。
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
