DTSTAMP:20260918T132400Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
SUMMARY:W5D7 — Long Run 60min + Swim 1500–1600yd
DESCRIPTION:RUN — 60 min easy\n• RPE 2–3/10\n• 全程可对话\n• 不做 fast finish\n\nSWIM — 25 yd pool\n总量：约 1500–1600 yd\n\n1) Warm-up — 300 yd\n• Easy freestyle\n• 目标：2:10–2:20 /100 yd\n\n2) Technique — 4×50 yd drill/swim\n• 25 drill + 25 swim\n• 休 15 sec\n\n3) Main Set — 5×150 yd\n• 目标：3:05–3:12 /150 yd\n• 约 2:03–2:08 /100 yd\n• 休 20 sec\n• RPE 4/10\n\n4) Smooth 50s — 4×50 yd\n• 目标：1:00–1:04 /50 yd\n• 休 15 sec\n\n5) Cool-down — 200 yd easy\n\n若肩部疲劳明显，可减少 1 组150。
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
